<title>JAPAN: Sony Corp shares jump to year's high.</title>
<headline>Sony Corp shares jump to year's high.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Sony Corp jumped to the highest level for this year on Wednesday morning.</p>
<p>The share price briefly rose to 7,320 yen, breaking above its previous high for the year of 7,310 yen marked on June 26, 1996.  </p>
<p>Sony's shares were supported by cyclical buying, as those who had earlier bought blue-chip issues such as Honda Motor Co Ltd and Toyota Motor Corp took profits and bought Sony, said a broker at a Japanese securities house.</p>
</text>
